    "title": "21-Day Family Itinerary: Bali, Singapore, Bangkok & Hong Kong",
    "excerpt": "The ultimate 3-week Asian adventure connecting 4 iconic cities — designed for families with kids aged 4-12. Day-by-day plans, transport between cities, budget breakdown, and real parent tips for multi-city travel with children.",
