    "title": "Bali Family Travel Guide: Best Resorts & Activities for Kids 2026",
    "excerpt": "The ultimate family guide to Bali. Kid-friendly resorts in Seminyak, Nusa Dua, and Ubud. Best activities for children, safety tips, and budget breakdown.",
    "date": "2026-05-16",
