    "title": "Best Family-Friendly Hotels in Tokyo for 2026 — Reviewed by Parents",
    "excerpt": "Finding the right hotel in Tokyo with kids can make or break your trip. We road-tested 5 top family hotels across Tokyo — here's what worked, what didn't, and which one suits your family best.",
    "date": "2026-04-28",
